  "content": {
    "productName": "Isotherm WS Jacket - Women's",
    "productFullDescription": "<div>• Windproof fabric protects your core and shoulders from the wind and cold without sacrificing breathability and mobility</div><div>• Underarm and rear panels with moisture-wicking, quick-drying FlashDry fibers draw moisture away from skin to keep you more comfortable when working hard in cold weather&nbsp;</div><div>• Fabric mapping delivers optimum temperature regulation in gender-specific thermal zones to keep you more comfortable during long-distance Nordic ski sessions</div><div>• Reflective taping can be seen from any angle</div><div>• Thumbholes; secure rear pocket; shaped hem; reflective logos&nbsp;</div><div>• Athlete tested and competition proven, The North Face Isotherm WS jacket for women is part of the Flight Series® collection</div>",
    "productShortDescription": "<div>The North Face Isotherm WS jacket for women uses GORE WINDSTOPPER® fabric with FlashDry™ fibers in the side panels to regulate your temperature while Nordic skiing in cold weather.&nbsp;</div><div><br></div>",
